{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sci-fi simulation game in which you take the role of the Emergency Pod Management Bot (EPMB) on a spaceship. The inhabitants of the medbay pods have been put into cryosleep due to the length of the journey. Somewhere along the way, disaster strikes, ripping apart the hull and disabling most of the automated systems. It is your job to keep the patients alive, healthy, and asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The global number of crew members that have lived and died across all users is displayed on the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The default setting for the game will pull users from your Steam friends list to use as crew members.<i> This option can be disabled in the settings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your character for your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the crew manifest, if you customize your own character, then when your friends are playing they can see your customized character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your friend's characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the crew manifest, you can customize your friends' characters.<i> Note that this will overwrite your friends' custom characters.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436420?t=1743620013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436420?t=1743620013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436420/549e6fb6057686169745a1467a886777fe033dba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743620013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436420/549e6fb6057686169745a1467a886777fe033dba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743620013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sci-fi simulation game in which you take the role of the Emergency Pod Management Bot (EPMB) on a spaceship. The inhabitants of the medbay pods have been put into cryosleep due to the length of the journey. Somewhere along the way, disaster strikes, ripping apart the hull and disabling most of the automated systems. It is your job to keep the patients alive, healthy, and asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The global number of crew members that have lived and died across all users is displayed on the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The default setting for the game will pull users from your Steam friends list to use as crew members.<i> This option can be disabled in the settings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your character for your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the crew manifest, if you customize your own character, then when your friends are playing they can see your customized character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your friend's characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the crew manifest, you can customize your friends' characters.<i> Note that this will overwrite your friends' custom characters.</i></p>","developers":["Beals Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436420/807b8ef7a05946de7e3f0576457c6ab4659c943d